5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current system is failing. I need to know the actual time cost before we commit to anything new.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,It feels unfair. I want to see who is actually using the spaces versus who is doing the work.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about the silence. I need to understand how we avoid conflict when things go wrong.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I am curious! I want to know what we are spending on supplies and if we are buying duplicates.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I feel anxious about the bathroom. I need to know why it gets dirty so quickly after cleaning.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, supplies are a cost, but time is the real resource. I am looking at the timing of a full clean.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
