35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The timing shows forty-seven minutes for the kitchen alone. With absences, the load is uneven.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The kitchen watch confirms it. Two people cook, the rest just make coffee. The work is skewed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The chat shows rows start with reminders. The previous tenants stopped speaking by year two.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The receipts show we buy spray twice a month. That is 2,300 yen wasted on duplicates.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The grout is black in eleven days. And ""done"" means different things to everyone. I am tired of guessing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, if two people cause the mess, they should do the work. But the absences make that hard.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, exactly. If we rotate, the coffee-drinkers get stuck with the heavy cooking mess. That is unfair.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, the money is a symptom. The real issue is that we avoid talking until it explodes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, I agree. But if we pay a service, we stop the arguments about who did what.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, a service might help. But I worry about the cost. I just want to know what is clean.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, the cost is high, but the time saved is real. I need to know if we can afford the hours.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I am worried about the fairness. If we pay, does the work disappear, or just the blame?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, if we pay, the blame disappears. But we still have to agree on the invoice. That is a new row.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, a new row is better than an old one! I want to know the firm's terms.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, I am listening. I just want a system where I don't have to brace myself before entering the bathroom.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I need to see the firm's terms. If they require us to tidy first, it defeats the purpose.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I need to see the management rate sheet. I want to know the real cost before we decide.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the standard terms. I want to know if this creates new dependencies.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I need to see the management rate sheet. I want to know if the bill goes to one person.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I need to see the standard terms. I want to know if they clean the grout properly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
