61,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option B is unfair. The heavy users get stuck with the light work in a rotation. I reject it.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option A is what the previous tenants did. It led to silence. I cannot support it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option C is great! But the bill goes to one person. Who collects from the rest?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option C seems safest. I don't want to guess. But I am worried about the cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
