72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,The risk of conflict is lowest here. I vote C.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote C! I want to stop the arguments and the wasted money on spray.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I vote C. I want to stop guessing. It feels like the right choice.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
